{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Censored Version \u2013 Free to Play!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the free version with pixelated censorship on the spicier camera angles (the ones with the dildos). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with cameras 1 and 2 (no censorship needed), and unlock more as you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craving every detail? Grab the uncensored DLC to\u00a0remove the pixelated censorship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your girls are drawn to the mysterious <strong>Bounce City</strong>, guided by their trusty dildo. The more pleasure they feel, the closer they seem to get to the city\u2026 but it\u2019s an endless ride. Will they make it? \u00af\\<i>( \u0361\u25e1\u035c\u0296 \u0361\u25e1)</i>/\u00af </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this cheeky, adults-only adventure packed with vibrant stages and thrilling challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Your Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite from a diverse lineup of girls.\u00a0Customize their outfits, accessories, and even their dildo color to make the journey uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/59e1bf4e79c80d3e3f39253dd34bb8fe.avif?t=1758678005\" data-has-big width=1560 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/dfed210199c891374b271c2e13dc35df.avif?t=1758678005\" data-has-big width=1560 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you\u2019ll gradually unlock new <strong>Camera angles</strong> to view the action from different perspectives (by collecting special &quot;Cameras&quot;).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special <strong>Clothes</strong> items to make your characters\u2019 outfits progressively more revealing, layer by layer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once fully unlocked, you can go straight to your favorite look every time!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn animations</strong> bring every bounce and jiggle to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock &quot;Cameras&quot; and &quot;Clothes&quot; either by <strong>collecting them in Arcade Mode</strong> or <strong>choosing special routes in Adventure Mode</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode \u2013 Classic Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/62c381262822127a8f58d470434e0352.poster.avif?t=1758678005\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/62c381262822127a8f58d470434e0352.webm?t=1758678005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/62c381262822127a8f58d470434e0352.mp4?t=1758678005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge obstacles and feel the rush in Arcade Mode! Guide your character across five lanes to dodge obstacles, collect items, and chase the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage brings <strong>unique obstacles, epic boss battles, and dynamic music</strong>, keeping each run exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure Mode \u2013 Randomized Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/08ed42e0e3852ad0faa1a683821da5f2.avif?t=1758678005\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode offers <strong>strategic variety</strong> and <strong>endless replayability</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with a <strong>random character, stage, outfit, and hat</strong> (if unlocked).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From there, navigate a branching map to <strong>choose your next unlockable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arena Mode \u2013 Relax and Bounce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/02068b91073655d794351db11ab1e269.poster.avif?t=1758678005\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/02068b91073655d794351db11ab1e269.webm?t=1758678005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/02068b91073655d794351db11ab1e269.mp4?t=1758678005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break in the Arena for a laid-back vibe. Unlike Arcade\u2019s five-lane setup, here you can move freely across the screen while the character <strong>auto-shoots in a mini-boss battle</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Police Chase Mode \u2013 High-Speed Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/fed785937ed02dd4d4963f82842f51ee.poster.avif?t=1758678005\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/fed785937ed02dd4d4963f82842f51ee.webm?t=1758678005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1892370/extras/fed785937ed02dd4d4963f82842f51ee.mp4?t=1758678005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Cosette</strong>, the fearless policewoman, in a high-speed motorcycle chase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch your target before they escape to Bounce City in this <strong>action-packed side mode</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your <strong>multiplier</strong> with last-second dodges: x2 \u2192 x3 \u2192 x4.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>x4</strong>, smash through glowing obstacles for massive points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>Gold</strong> to unlock <strong>exclusive gallery scenes</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With new stages planned for future updates, the chase never stops!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lisa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892370/cf1ab5679325b8dcf0296d6a768c5dbba204ebb6.jpg"},{"name":"Jeanne","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892370/cf1ab5679325b8dcf0296d6a768c5dbba204ebb6.jpg"},{"name":"Endymion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892370/cf1ab5679325b8dcf0296d6a768c5dbba204ebb6.jpg"},{"name":"Sasha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892370/cf1ab5679325b8dcf0296d6a768c5dbba204ebb6.jpg"},{"name":"Paula","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892370/cf1ab5679325b8dcf0296d6a768c5dbba204ebb6.jpg"},{"name":"Bag of coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892370/cf1ab5679325b8dcf0296d6a768c5dbba204ebb6.jpg"},{"name":"Health restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1892370/cf1ab5679325b8dcf0296d6a768c5dbba204ebb6.jpg"},{"name":"Speed upgrad